# Build trees
**/build/
**/build-win/
**/build-cmake/
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/CMakeFiles/
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/Makefile
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.so
**/*.exe
!reference_code/**/*.exe

# .NET (C# shell): never commit build outputs or published binaries
**/bin/
**/obj/
csharp/**/publish/

# Engine + packaged releases (built artifacts)
working_code/gifscythe/release/*/gifsicle
working_code/gifscythe/release/*/gifsicle.exe
working_code/gifscythe/release/*/Gifscythe/
working_code/gifscythe/release/*/Gifscythe-system/

# Auto-fetched reference clones (large; re-fetch as needed)
reference_code/gifsicle-upstream/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.user

# Locally installed tooling (pip-provided cmake; not committed)
.tools/
.env
ui-shots/

# FFmpeg sidecar (fetched, never committed: 70-200 MB per platform).
# PINS.txt IS tracked - a pin nobody can see pins nothing.
vendor/ffmpeg/*
!vendor/ffmpeg/PINS.txt

# Python bytecode (qt_lint is imported by its own tests)
__pycache__/
